    {
      "id": "f692e417-7f2b-48cd-956f-f5d357fbe707",
      "name": "Sticky Note 51598141",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -50,
        -50
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## UXR Send & Stamp (Workflow C)\nInputs: batch_id, email_subject, email_body, calendly_url, test_mode.\n\nReads staged candidates from uxr_candidates by batch_id, sends the invite per candidate via SMTP (from noreply@info.n8n.io, reply-to design@n8n.io, plain text, no attribution), stamps last_user_research_invite_date on Customer.io via Track API (_update: true, never creates profiles), updates each candidate row to sent/failed, returns {success, sent, failed, details}.\n\n**test_mode: true** = recipients overridden to design@n8n.io + g.andreini@gmail.com, max 2 candidates, NO stamping. Refuses to run if the body still contains {{calendly_link}} and no calendly_url is given.\n\n**Credentials pending**: SMTP (Mailgun) and Customer.io Track API must be added by Rob before this can actually send.",
        "color": 4,
        "width": 524,
        "height": 200
      }
    }
